[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver/tests/semver_solver_impl_test.py: Resolved all five coverage feedback items: added equal-numeric/equal-string/equal-sequence prerelease precedence endpoints; relational comparator mismatch branches (equality mismatch, inclusive-upper overshoot, strict-greater equality, >= equality, < and != mismatch); wildcard/caret/tilde operand expansion boundaries (*, 1.x, !=*, >*, <=*, <=1.x, <1.x, ^*, ~*, ~1.x, >1.*, ^1.x, ~1.2.x, >=1.x, !=1.x, >=*) with parse_range acceptance for those operand forms; hyphen range with a full-version inclusive upper bound (1.0.0 - 2.0.0); and a solver scenario where a candidate release depends on an already-assigned package with a violating range, forcing the assigned-dependency conflict branch to backtrack and report ResolutionConflictError.
